# Title: DNS Server Discovery Via LDAP Query
# ID: a21bcd7e-38ec-49ad-b69a-9ea17e69509e
# Status: test
# Level: low
# Author: frack113
# Date: 2022-08-20
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1482
# Description: Detects DNS server discovery via LDAP query requests from uncommon applications
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((@QueryName:_ldap.*) AND -(((@Image:*:\\ProgramData\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\Platform\\* AND @Image:*\\MsMpEng.exe) OR ((@Image:*:\\Program Files\\* OR @Image:*:\\Program Files (x86)\\* OR @Image:*:\\Windows\\*)) OR (-@Image:*) OR (@Image:"<unknown process>"))) AND -(((@Image:C:\\WindowsAzure\\GuestAgent*) OR ((@Image:*\\chrome.exe OR @Image:*\\firefox.exe OR @Image:*\\opera.exe)))))
